5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I believe we should examine our reporting transparency. I'll look into independent checks on holdings' reported figures and appraisal needs at the last audit.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I want to verify our actual success drivers. I will check the profile of the exits and the write-off, and account retention through price rises.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We must ensure our long-term liquidity. I'll investigate reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm worried about our bandwidth! I'll check the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about deployment timelines. I will look into the security review time before first deployment and delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
