25,2,1,talk,Servas,,It seems physical assets provide better verification but complicate our audits significantly. We must weigh transparency against the cost of closing our books.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Our wins come from back-office tooling, while operational businesses are riskier. However, some niche services show impressive resilience during price hikes.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Minako,,"Our reserves are being depleted faster than expected. Furthermore, our credit line is useless for subscription-based models; it only favors physical stock.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Mio,,"We have plenty of software expertise on the board, but we are completely lacking in operational and field management support.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Hardware and regulated data cause massive delays. Software is faster, provided it doesn't touch sensitive records or rely on complex supply chains.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Servas,,"If we choose a company with physical goods, we must accept a slower, more expensive quarter-end process.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree. The data suggests that lean software tools are our safest bet for actual returns.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Minako,,"But remember, if we need to borrow, a company with tangible assets is the only way to leverage our credit line.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Mio,,"And if we go the operational route, we can't rely on our current recruiters to find the right managers quickly.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Toshio,,The risk of a six-month delay is too high for me. I prefer a path with minimal security hurdles.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
