50,3,1,talk,Servas,,Ledger Bridge offers the best reporting simplicity. Harvest Sensor and Fabric Loop would make our audits a nightmare.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Clinic Scheduler and Harvest Sensor have great retention, but Ledger Bridge fits the profile of our most successful exits.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Minako,,Fabric Loop or Harvest Sensor would allow us to use our credit line. Ledger Bridge and Clinic Scheduler offer no such security.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Mio,,I can't support Fabric Loop or Harvest Sensor; we have no one to help them hire field crews or supervisors.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Clinic Scheduler will be trapped in security reviews for months. Ledger Bridge is the fastest route to deployment.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Servas,,I vote for Ledger Bridge. It keeps our reporting clean and avoids the appraisal fees.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Ledger Bridge is the most logical choice based on our historical wins.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Minako,,"I still worry about the cash, but I cannot ignore the staffing and reporting warnings. I'll go with Ledger Bridge.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Mio,,"Ledger Bridge it is! Our partners are already software-heavy, so it fits our current board capacity.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Toshio,,Ledger Bridge avoids the supply chain and regulatory traps I fear. My vote is cast.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
